<title>USA: Fund American Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Fund American Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, N.H. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $3.99   profit	 $0.29</p>
<p> Net	   loss	31,060   profit	 2,439</p>
<p> Revs			    73			 54</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,105		    7,539</p>
<p>		 year</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.60   profit	 $9.36</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 4,906   profit	84,129</p>
<p> Revs			   333			222</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,429		    7,794</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fund American Enterprises Holdings Inc said its net income for fiscal year 1995 included non-recurring items of $42.3 million, or $4.58 per fully diluted share.</p>
<p>The 1996 fourth quarter included a $33.6 million pretax ($30.0 million after tax) writeoff of all of Source One's existing goodwill and certain other intangible assets.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal year 1995 did not include dividends on preferred stock of $3,834,000.</p>
